Activity 2 – Personal Branding

Description

Created a personal branding kit for Dot & Flash, featuring a brand name, logo, tagline, color palette, and typography to establish a consistent visual identity.

What Have I Learned?

Through this activity, I learned how important personal branding is in creating a recognizable identity. I realized that choosing the right name, logo, colors, and fonts helps communicate a brand's personality and make it stand out. I also learned that consistency plays an important role in building a strong brand.
